@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy policy";
}

<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-20">
    <span class="text-[11px] font-sans tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-gold-400">Information</span>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ivory-100 mt-2 mb-6">Privacy policy</h1>

    <div class="space-y-5 font-garamond text-[17px] text-ivory-200/85 leading-relaxed">
        <p>AryTix respects the privacy of its viewers. This policy describes what personal data we collect, why we collect it and how we protect it.</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ivory-100 mt-8 mb-2">Data we collect</h2>
        <p>To issue a ticket we need a username, an email address and information about the seats you chose and the amounts paid. Card data is processed through a secure payment channel and is not stored by us.</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ivory-100 mt-8 mb-2">What we use it for</h2>
        <p>Strictly to fulfil your booking, send confirmations and QR codes, and to maintain and improve the service.</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ivory-100 mt-8 mb-2">Security</h2>
        <p>We apply HTTP security headers, CSRF protection, role-based authorization and encrypted transport. We never share your data with third parties without your consent.</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ivory-100 mt-8 mb-2">Your rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to request access, correction or deletion of your personal data. Contact us at the email address listed at the bottom of the page.</p>
    </div>
</section>
